; The @go-git-cms scope lives on GitHub Packages, not npmjs.com. Reads are
; authenticated even for public repos, so an install that actually pulls
; @go-git-cms/plugin-sdk or @go-git-cms/design-system needs a read:packages
; token in ~/.npmrc:  //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=<token>
@go-git-cms:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
